1
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:52,400
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,120
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 18=

5
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:00,799
You ungrateful brat!

6
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:02,439
Why do you insist on
walking right into the blade?

7
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:11,280
Natuo!

8
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,319
What are you doing?

9
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,799
What are you doing?

10
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:28,799
What are you doing?

11
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:30,680
What are you doing?

12
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,760
Scared now, are you?

13
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:32,799
Too late!

14
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,840
You monster! Let her go!

15
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,079
Worried about her?

16
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:42,920
Are you?

17
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,239
I'll make you watch

18
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,799
what I do to your woman!

19
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:47,840
Get up!

20
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,280
Hudie!

21
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,000
Hudie!

22
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:09,919
Hudie!

23
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:10,879
Hudie!

24
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,159
Layla!

25
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:19,759
Hudie!

26
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,520
Let go.

27
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:23,719
Let go.

28
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,919
Let go!

29
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:25,550
You.

30
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,520
You.

31
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,280
Let go.

32
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,520
You think

33
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:43,840
you're some rich lady?

34
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,080
You're nothing but a lowlife.

35
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,599
Let her go!

36
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,800
Just because you're my stepmom,

37
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:50,879
you think I won't touch you?

38
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:04,800
Scream.

39
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,159
Go on, scream.

40
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,319
I've never been some rich lady.

41
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,759
I made my own way in this world.

42
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,960
You witch!

43
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,520
How dare you hurt me?

44
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:23,759
Die!

45
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:24,840
Die!

46
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,599
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

47
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:28,800
Save Hudie.

48
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:29,719
Save Hudie.

49
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,360
They all say

50
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:40,884
I only wanted

51
00:03:40,885 --> 00:03:42,599
the Songcai family's wealth and status.

52
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,759
They say I sleep around.

53
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,280
But I don't care at all.

54
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:53,240
From now on,

55
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,199
I just want to live for myself.

56
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,719
I understand.

57
00:03:58,599 --> 00:03:59,400
Get some rest.

58
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,639
I'll get you a doctor.

59
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:10,400
Medicine.

60
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,240
Give me medicine.

61
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:14,639
Give me medicine. I feel awful.

62
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,279
Medicine. Give me medicine.

63
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,520
Medicine.

64
00:04:37,521 --> 00:04:38,040
Quick.

65
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:38,959
Give me medicine.

66
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:40,879
Medicine.

67
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,439
Give it to me.

68
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,199
You want it?

69
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:47,160
Give me ownership of Grand Royal too.

70
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,360
Then I'll give it to you.

71
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,120
You...

72
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,120
vicious...

73
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,319
woman!

74
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,639
Forget it, then.

75
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,199
Fine.

76
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:58,360
Give it to me.

77
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,279
I'll give you everything.

78
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,439
Everything.

79
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:02,720
Give me the medicine.

80
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,199
Give it to me.

81
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,300
Ren.

82
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,319
What's up?

83
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,399
(Zhou Yan.)

84
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,000
Mian.

85
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,160
(You've been making quite a stir.)

86
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:46,160
(You remind me of myself back then.)

87
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:48,199
(You want Natuo dead?)

88
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,600
(I can make that happen.)

89
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:50,720
(But)

90
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:52,639
(I want you to stop)

91
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:55,040
(going after Grand Royal right now.)

92
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,279
Mian won't let me go after Grand Royal?

93
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,279
That's right.

94
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,439
Why?

95
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:05,959
Give me a reason.

96
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,920
I'm just the messenger.

97
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:11,720
I never ask why.

98
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:12,839
Ren.

99
00:06:14,199 --> 00:06:15,199
We've been through hell together.

100
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:17,000
I've always thought of you as a brother.

101
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,720
Now I have one question.

102
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,399
Whose side are you on?

103
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:28,160
I'll always stand with Mian.

104
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,000
Fine.

105
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:31,560
I understand.

106
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:44,759
I'm sorry, Ren.

107
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,600
I don't want to put you in a tough spot.

108
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:48,373
Sihan ended up in that hellhole

109
00:06:48,374 --> 00:06:49,160
because of Grand Royal.

110
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,720
Whether it's Natuo or Grand Royal,

111
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,600
I'll destroy them both.

112
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,639
Hurry.

113
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,680
Get in the car.

114
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,319
Hurry.

115
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:19,920
Get in.

116
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,680
Everyone, get in.

117
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,160
Hurry.

118
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,560
Lock the door.

119
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,120
Take everything with you.

120
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:24,959
Go, go.

121
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:25,879
Get those over there, too.

122
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:26,920
Be careful.

123
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,000
Take your stuff.

124
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,560
Hurry, keep up.

125
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:28,959
Lock the door.

126
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:34,680
Oh, my.

127
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,759
What brings you here?

128
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:37,680
Daya.

129
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,360
I...

130
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,399
I wanted to tell you.

131
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:42,399
I just...

132
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:45,079
What did you want to tell me?

133
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,079
Ma Ding.

134
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,002
Your buddies

135
00:07:47,003 --> 00:07:48,439
are still waiting outside.

136
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,325
Why are you

137
00:07:50,326 --> 00:07:51,040
still dawdling around here?

138
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,000
Go on, hurry.

139
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:09,920
Daya.

140
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,040
I wanted to tell you.

141
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,560
I love the fish soup noodles you make.

142
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:16,493
I think they're

143
00:08:16,494 --> 00:08:17,600
the best thing in the world.

144
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,720
But I love you even more.

145
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,079
So

146
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,204
once we

147
00:08:23,205 --> 00:08:24,839
deal with Natuo and Grand Royal,

148
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,480
let's settle down together.

149
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,319
How about it?

150
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:40,679
Ma Ding.

151
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:42,679
Let me tell you something.

152
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,519
I used to think

153
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,339
I'd spend the rest of my life

154
00:08:46,340 --> 00:08:47,399
rotting away at Grand Royal.

155
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,320
It's the biggest stain on my life.

156
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:55,240
I need to leave my past behind for good

157
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:58,559
before I have the courage to start over.

158
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:00,360
Do you understand?

159
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:04,240
Okay.

160
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,480
Once I deal with the Grand Royal,

161
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,000
make me fish soup noodles again.

162
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:10,200
Okay?

163
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,200
Here's the wine you ordered.

164
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:27,600
Ma Ding.

165
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,639
This is the wine we bought.

166
00:10:28,799 --> 00:10:29,445
Expensive wine

167
00:10:29,446 --> 00:10:30,480
really does taste different.

168
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:31,360
Try it.

169
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,679
We're here to stir things up.

170
00:10:42,919 --> 00:10:44,307
Drop that clueless,

171
00:10:44,308 --> 00:10:45,279
country-bumpkin act.

172
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,360
Watch and learn.

173
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,919
Who dared serve me this fake booze?

174
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,080
Manager!

175
00:11:02,519 --> 00:11:03,159
Manager, come here.

176
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:03,480
Come here.

177
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,720
Let's talk.

178
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,399
I need a word with you.

179
00:11:06,399 --> 00:11:07,200
What's up, bro?

180
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,120
Come here.

181
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:08,700
Okay.

182
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:09,879
What's wrong?

183
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:15,120
I ordered your most expensive wine.

184
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:17,080
And what did you serve me?

185
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,039
This tastes watered down.

186
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,360
You think you can fool us?

187
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,919
I'm sorry.

188
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:23,960
How about this?

189
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,559
I'll take the tip off the bill.

190
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,120
And I'll send some hostesses

191
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,440
over to make it up to you.

192
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:29,440
How's that?

193
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,919
I'm taken now.

194
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,080
What did you say?

195
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,399
I said,

196
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,679
no!

197
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,279
You here to cause trouble?

198
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,000
If you don't want to die,

199
00:12:06,879 --> 00:12:08,039
keep dancing.

200
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,799
Get your boss over here.

201
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,000
Oh, my.

202
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:23,879
What's with that?

203
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:25,000
Are you doing a zombie act?

204
00:12:26,559 --> 00:12:27,600
Stretch it out a little more.

205
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,840
You'll look just like
a hostess from Grand Royal.

206
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:30,879
This is killing me.

207
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,240
What a little punk.

208
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:39,879
I'll handle him.

209
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,759
What are you doing?

210
00:12:43,039 --> 00:12:43,799
Take him down?

211
00:12:43,799 --> 00:12:44,120
Yeah.

212
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,879
Look at the difference in strength.

213
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,000
I'll go.

214
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,039
Oh, my.

215
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,919
Hey, Qiang.

216
00:12:54,279 --> 00:12:55,919
What brings you here alone tonight?

217
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:56,919
Daya.

218
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:59,080
It's been a while.

219
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,320
Miss me?

220
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:01,759
Oh, come on.

221
00:13:01,759 --> 00:13:03,399
Of course I've missed you.

222
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,639
There's no one

223
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:07,480
around here.

224
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:08,799
How about

225
00:13:09,279 --> 00:13:10,679
we go somewhere else?

226
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:11,600
Sure.

227
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,720
Qiang.

228
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,960
It stinks and it's filthy here.

229
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:18,600
Let's go somewhere else.

230
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:19,559
Come on.

231
00:13:19,799 --> 00:13:20,320
Sure.

232
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,120
Let's go out and have some fun.

233
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:21,799
Let's go.

234
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,399
You go ahead.

235
00:13:56,279 --> 00:13:57,440
- Qiang.
- Come on.

236
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,519
Don't rush me.

237
00:13:58,519 --> 00:13:59,159
Come on.

238
00:13:59,159 --> 00:13:59,799
Qiang.

239
00:14:00,279 --> 00:14:01,080
There's someone here.

240
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,879
Why are you acting so innocent?

241
00:14:04,519 --> 00:14:05,279
Girls who come here

242
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,360
are all for hire.

243
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:08,519
Make me feel good,

244
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,080
and I'll look out for you.

245
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,720
Qiang.

246
00:14:14,279 --> 00:14:15,399
There's no bed here.

247
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,279
You little punk.

248
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,600
What are you doing?

249
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,680
♪Dust rises along the border♪

250
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,000
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

251
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,360
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

252
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,760
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

253
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:43,120
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

254
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,440
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

255
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,760
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

256
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,440
♪My life is mine to bear♪

257
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:50,280
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

258
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:52,880
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

259
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,200
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

260
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:56,280
♪My fate is mine to command♪

261
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,560
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

262
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:58,840
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

263
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,160
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

264
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,440
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

265
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:02,800
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

266
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,120
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

267
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,440
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

268
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:06,720
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

269
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,080
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

270
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,600
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

271
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,000
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

272
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,360
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

273
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:15,400
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

274
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,080
♪With blood and sweat♪

275
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,480
♪I forge my glory♪

276
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:21,880
♪In this world of chaos♪

277
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:22,960
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

278
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,440
♪My legend♪

279
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,920
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

280
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:33,080
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

281
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:35,920
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

282
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:38,040
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

283
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,320
♪My fate is mine to command♪

284
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,600
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

285
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:49,880
♪My fate is mine to command♪

286
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,640
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
